#: ../../source/samples/pmp.md:6
msgid "PMP Driver Sample"
msgstr "PMP 驱动示例"

#: ../../source/samples/pmp.md:8
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/samples/pmp.md:10
msgid ""
"A sample application demonstrating the usage of the TLK PMP API. It "
"protects the upper half of a 16-element array against all access, then "
"attempts to read or write the full array, triggering a PMP violation trap"
" on the protected region."
msgstr ""
"一个示例应用程序，演示了 TLK PMP API 的使用。它将一个包含 16 个元素的数组的上半部分保护起来，禁止所有访问，然后尝试读写整个数组，从而在被保护区域触发 PMP 违规异常。"

#: ../../source/samples/pmp.md:14
msgid "How It Works"
msgstr "工作原理"

#: ../../source/samples/pmp.md:16
msgid "On startup the sample:"
msgstr "启动时，该示例："

#: ../../source/samples/pmp.md:18
msgid ""
"*(Optional)* Configures PMP protection on `demo_array[8..15]` using the "
"selected address matching scheme. All permissions are disabled and the "
"entry is locked (`l = 1`)."
msgstr ""
"*(可选)* 使用选定的地址匹配方案在 `demo_array[8..15]` 上配置 PMP 保护。所有权限都被禁用，并且条目被锁定（`l = 1`）。"

#: ../../source/samples/pmp.md:20
msgid ""
"*(Optional)* If `CONFIG_TLK_PMP_DEMO_SLEEP` is set, enters sleep for 500 "
"ms and wakes up, demonstrating that PMP state is correctly saved and "
"restored across the sleep."
msgstr ""
"*(可选)* 如果设置了 `CONFIG_TLK_PMP_DEMO_SLEEP`，则进入睡眠 500 毫秒并唤醒，演示 PMP 状态在睡眠过程中正确保存和恢复。"

#: ../../source/samples/pmp.md:22
msgid "Iterates over all 16 elements of `demo_array`:"
msgstr "遍历 `demo_array` 的所有 16 个元素："

#: ../../source/samples/pmp.md:23
msgid "With `CONFIG_TLK_PMP_DEMO_READ` — reads and logs each value."
msgstr "启用 `CONFIG_TLK_PMP_DEMO_READ` — 读取并记录每个值。"

#: ../../source/samples/pmp.md:24
msgid "With `CONFIG_TLK_PMP_DEMO_WRITE` — writes and logs each value."
msgstr "启用 `CONFIG_TLK_PMP_DEMO_WRITE` — 写入并记录每个值。"

#: ../../source/samples/pmp.md:26
msgid ""
"Elements `[0..7]` complete successfully. On the first access to "
"`demo_array[8]` a PMP violation trap is raised."
msgstr ""
"元素 `[0..7]` 访问成功。当首次访问 `demo_array[8]` 时，会触发 PMP 违规异常。"

#: ../../source/samples/pmp.md:29
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置"

#: ../../source/samples/pmp.md:31
msgid "All options are exposed via **Kconfig** under *PMP Demo Configuration*."
msgstr "所有选项都通过 **Kconfig** 中的 *PMP Demo Configuration* 提供。"

#: ../../source/samples/pmp.md
msgid "Symbol"
msgstr "符号"

#: ../../source/samples/pmp.md
msgid "Type"
msgstr "类型"

#: ../../source/samples/pmp.md
msgid "Default"
msgstr "默认值"

#: ../../source/samples/pmp.md
msgid "Description"
msgstr "描述"

#: ../../source/samples/pmp.md
msgid "`TLK_PMP_DEMO_TOR`"
msgstr "`TLK_PMP_DEMO_TOR`"

#: ../../source/samples/pmp.md
msgid "`bool`"
msgstr "`bool`"

#: ../../source/samples/pmp.md
msgid "`n`"
msgstr "`n`"

#: ../../source/samples/pmp.md
msgid ""
"Protect `demo_array[8..15]` using TOR address matching. Entry 0 holds the"
" lower bound; Entry 1 holds the upper bound."
msgstr "使用 TOR 地址匹配保护 `demo_array[8..15]`。条目 0 保存下限；条目 1 保存上限。"

#: ../../source/samples/pmp.md
msgid "`TLK_PMP_DEMO_NAPOT`"
msgstr "`TLK_PMP_DEMO_NAPOT`"

#: ../../source/samples/pmp.md
msgid "Protect `demo_array[8..15]` using NAPOT address matching."
msgstr "使用 NAPOT 地址匹配保护 `demo_array[8..15]`。"

#: ../../source/samples/pmp.md
msgid "`TLK_PMP_DEMO_READ`"
msgstr "`TLK_PMP_DEMO_READ`"

#: ../../source/samples/pmp.md
msgid "Access the array by reading."
msgstr "通过读取操作访问数组。"

#: ../../source/samples/pmp.md
msgid "`TLK_PMP_DEMO_WRITE`"
msgstr "`TLK_PMP_DEMO_WRITE`"

#: ../../source/samples/pmp.md
msgid "Access the array by writing."
msgstr "通过写入操作访问数组。"

#: ../../source/samples/pmp.md
msgid "`TLK_PMP_DEMO_SLEEP`"
msgstr "`TLK_PMP_DEMO_SLEEP`"

#: ../../source/samples/pmp.md
msgid ""
"Enter the sleep between PMP configuration and array access. Demonstrates "
"PMP state retention across sleep."
msgstr "在 PMP 配置和数组访问之间进入睡眠。演示 PMP 状态在睡眠期间的保持能力。"

#: ../../source/samples/pmp.md:41
msgid ""
"**Note:** If neither `TLK_PMP_DEMO_TOR` nor `TLK_PMP_DEMO_NAPOT` is set, "
"no protection is configured and all 16 elements are accessible without a "
"fault."
msgstr ""
"**注意：** 如果既未设置 `TLK_PMP_DEMO_TOR` 也未设置 `TLK_PMP_DEMO_NAPOT`，则不配置任何保护，所有 16 个元素均可正常访问，不会触发异常。"
